xt-green-500\" size={18} />\n                  <span className=\"text-sm\">Follows Portal App framework conventions</span>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Sentinel Card */}\n            <div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8 transition-colors hover:border-purple-500/50\">\n              <div className=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div className=\"rounded bg-purple-500/20 p-2\">\n                  <Shield className=\"text-purple-400\" size={24} />\n                </div>\n                <h3 className=\"text-xl font-bold\">Sentinel (Code Reviewer)</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mb-6 text-slate-400\">\n                Intelligent review system that validates and auto-corrects code violations.\n              </p>\n              <ul className=\"space-y-3\">\n                <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\"mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500\" size={18} />\n                  <span className=\"text-sm\">Reviews generated code for violations</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\"mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500\" size={18} />\n                  <span className=\"text-sm\">Auto-corrects issues automatically</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\"mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500\" size={18} />\n                  <span className=\"text-sm\">Fixes, never rejects</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex gap-3\">\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\"mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500\" size={18} />\n                  <span className=\"text-sm\">Maintains code quality standards</span>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      {/* Patch System */}\n      <section className=\"border-b border-slate-800 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\">\n          <h2 className=\"mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-bold\">\n            <FileJson className=\"text-emerald-400\" size={28} />\n            Patch System\n          </h2>\n\n          <div className=\"mb-8 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8\">\n            <p className=\"mb-6 text-slate-300\">\n              All changes generated by the Runner and corrected by Sentinel are stored in the{' '}\n              <code className=\"rounded bg-slate-800 px-2 py-1 text-sm text-emerald-400\">.portal/patches</code>{' '}\n              directory. This creates an audit trail of all modifications.\n            </p>\n\n            <div className=\"mb-6 rounded border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 p-6\">\n              <div className=\"mb-3 font-mono text-sm text-slate-400\">Directory Structure</div>\n              <pre className=\"overflow-x-auto text-sm text-slate-300\">\n                {`.portal/\n├── patches/\n│   ├── 2024-01-15_component-button.json\n│   ├── 2024-01-15_page-dashboard.json\n│   ├── 2024-01-16_fix-accessibility.json\n│   └── manifest.json\n├── config.json\n└── state.json`}\n              </pre>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\">\n              <div>\n                <h4 className=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-slate-200\">\n                  <GitBranch size={18} className=\"text-emerald-400\" />\n                  Patch Contents\n                </h4>\n                <ul className=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                  <li>&bull; Original code before changes</li>\n                  <li>&bull; Generated code from Runner</li>\n                  <li>&bull; Corrections from Sentinel</li>\n                  <li>&bull; Violation details and fixes</li>\n                  <li>&bull; Timestamp and metadata</li>\n       